{"item_uid": "指考94-math_jia-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔78分)", "stem": "令 i = −1， z 表複數 z的共軛複數。在複數平面上，所有滿足方程式\n(1+i)z−(1−i)z =0的複數 z，會形成下列哪種的圖形？\n（1） 一點\n（2） 一圓\n（3） 一直線\n（4） 兩直線\n-1-\n94年指考 第 2 頁\n數 學 甲 共 6 頁", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 13.0, "C": 43.0, "D": 8.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 11.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 69.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 25.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 23.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 17.0, "p_value": 43.0, "p_high": 69.0, "p_low": 23.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [77.0, 53.0, 37.0, 29.0, 20.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-math_jia-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔78分)", "stem": "設 f(x) = x2 +a(1− x2)為一實係數多項式函數， a為常數。下列敘述何者正確：\n（1） 不論 a是何值， f(x)的函數圖形都不可能是直線。\n（2） 不論 a是何值，若 f(x)有極值，則極值都等於 a。（註：極大值與極小\n值統稱極值）\n（3） 0 有可能是 f(x)的極大值。\n（4） 若 a ≠ 0，則 f(x) =0無重根。", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 17.0, "B": 65.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 63.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 84.0, "C": 39.0, "D": 75.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 33.0, "B": 46.0, "C": 58.0, "D": 50.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": 30.0, "p_high": 58.0, "p_low": 3.0, "discrimination": 55.0, "p_quintiles": [66.0, 42.0, 29.0, 16.0, -4.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-math_jia-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔78分)", "stem": "如圖，ABCD是邊長為 1 的正方形，在 AB、BC、\nCD、 DA四邊上依序任取一點 P、Q、 R、S（皆\n非頂點）。若 PQRS是長方形但不是正方形，下\n列敘述何者正確：\n（1） ∆SAP與 ∆PBQ相似。\n（2） ∆SAP和 ∆QCR全等。\n（3） PB =QB。\n1\n（4） ∆PBQ的最大可能面積為 。\n2\n-2-\n第 3 頁 94年指考\n共 6 頁 數 學 甲", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 87.0, "B": 94.0, "C": 52.0, "D": 21.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 95.0, "B": 98.0, "C": 55.0, "D": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 76.0, "B": 87.0, "C": 46.0, "D": 33.0}, "omit_rate": 2.0, "p_value": 57.0, "p_high": 70.0, "p_low": 40.0, "discrimination": 30.0, "p_quintiles": [72.0, 66.0, 61.0, 53.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-math_jia-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔78分)", "stem": "球面 x2 + y2 + z2 = 4 與空間中兩點 P =(1, −2, 1) , Q =( −1, 2, −1) 的關係\n是：\n（1） 直線 PQ和球面交於兩點。\n（2） 線段 PQ和球面交於兩點。\n（3） 直線 PQ與球面相切。\n（4） 直線 PQ通過球心。", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 79.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 75.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 95.0, "B": 86.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 94.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 58.0, "B": 48.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 52.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 59.0, "p_high": 88.0, "p_low": 24.0, "discrimination": 64.0, "p_quintiles": [91.0, 80.0, 65.0, 44.0, 14.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-math_jia-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔78分)", "stem": "宴會在場的 50 位賓客有人偷了主人的珠寶，由於賓客身上都沒有珠寶，而且\n他們都不承認偷竊。警方決定動用測謊器，並且只問客人一個問題：「你有沒\n有偷珠寶？」。已知若某人說謊，則測謊器顯示他說謊的機率為 99％；若某人\n誠實，則測謊器顯示他誠實的機率是 90％。下列敘述何者正確：\n（1） 設竊賊只有一人。當賓客受測時，測謊器顯示賓客說謊的機率大於 10％。\n（2） 設竊賊只有一人。當測謊器顯示一賓客說謊時，該賓客正是竊賊的機率\n大於 50％。\n（3） 設竊賊只有一人，當測謊器顯示一賓客誠實時，該賓客卻是竊賊的機率\n小於 20％。\n（4） 當測謊器顯示一賓客說謊時，該賓客是竊賊的機率，並不因竊賊人數多\n少而改變。\n-3-\n94年指考 第 4 頁\n數 學 甲 共 6 頁\n 1  1", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 59.0, "B": 45.0, "C": 74.0, "D": 42.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 81.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 88.0, "D": 25.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 38.0, "B": 62.0, "C": 61.0, "D": 59.0}, "omit_rate": 12.0, "p_value": 23.0, "p_high": 60.0, "p_low": -11.0, "discrimination": 71.0, "p_quintiles": [71.0, 39.0, 20.0, 3.0, -19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-math_jia-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔78分)", "stem": "A是 2×2 方陣，設 A2 = A⋅A， A3 = A⋅A⋅A，以此類推。已知 A⋅ = ，\n   \n−1 1\n1 −1 a 3\nA⋅ = ，若有 a,b使得 A4 ⋅ = ，下列敘述何者正確：\n       \n1  1  b 2\n（1） a = −3。\n（2） b =2。\n 1  −1\n（3） A2 ⋅ = 。\n   \n−1  1 \n（4） A是一旋轉方陣。", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 80.0, "D": 69.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 91.0, "C": 93.0, "D": 85.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 22.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 54.0}, "omit_rate": 8.0, "p_value": 61.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 36.0, "discrimination": 48.0, "p_quintiles": [88.0, 76.0, 64.0, 50.0, 29.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考94-math_jia-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 94, "year_ce": 2005, "subject_key": "math_jia", "subject_zh": "數學甲", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題(佔78分)", "stem": "有一條拋物線位於坐標平面之上半面（即其 y坐標 ≥ 0），並與 x-軸、直線\ny = x−1、直線 y = −x−1相切。下列敘述何者正確：\n（1） 此拋物線的對稱軸必為 y-軸。\n（2） 若此拋物線對稱軸為 y-軸，則其焦距為 1。（註：拋物線的焦距為焦點到\n頂點的距離）\n（3） 此拋物線的頂點必在 x-軸上。\n（4） 有不只一條拋物線滿足此條件。\n-4-\n第 5 頁 94年指考\n共 6 頁 數 學 甲", "options": {}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": true, "option_dist_T": {"A": 77.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 68.0, "D": 39.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 79.0, "B": 57.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 42.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 73.0, "B": 44.0, "C": 67.0, "D": 36.0}, "omit_rate": 7.0, "p_value": -28.0, "p_high": -24.0, "p_low": -30.0, "discrimination": 6.0, "p_quintiles": [-20.0, -30.0, -31.0, -31.0, -30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
